{"id":"93950a9b94411f43","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Identity Relation On Set","display":"df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set — ZFC Set12 Identity Relation On Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set — ZFC Set12 Identity Relation On Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set — ZFC Set12 Identity Relation On Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (relation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}identity\\text{-}relation\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S(I,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nI=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}identity\\text{-}relation\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S(I,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nI=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Exact equality excludes non-pair junk and pairs outside the diagonal, which the previous pointwise condition did not rule out.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}identity\\text{-}relation\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S(I,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nI=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in A\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":859,"backlinks":[{"id":"050b38a22948395d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S$ is the identity-relation predicate (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md]])"},{"id":"ca566714b52a0471","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet12IdentityRelationOnSet}_S$ is the diagonal predicate (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set.md|58-df-zfc-set12-identity-relation-on-set]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}